{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAQnKYn3wWwqxrwXdNob","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012K2cDmLXJmGhxszXriLU9t","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add response_writer.go response_writer_test.go && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(response): refine hijack behavior for response lifecycle\n\nHijack rejected the connection as soon as Written() was true, which\nincludes the headers-only state (size == 0) reached via WriteHeaderNow\nor Flush. Websocket libraries such as github.com/coder/websocket hit\nthat state before hijacking. Only reject once body bytes are written.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":776,"cache_read_input_tokens":38362,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":776,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04d8b101-d211-4cd2-a2e5-75dcfbfc8f80","uuid":"29bd772a-61b5-4e1f-a642-6d6b20020f4d","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:27:11.186Z","request_id":"req_011CgAQnKKtTg6adJspMZ4ui","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_012K2cDmLXJmGhxszXriLU9t":{"command":"cd /tmp/tlw-hdtg8jlf && git add response_writer.go response_writer_test.go && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(response): refine hijack behavior for response lifecycle\n\nHijack rejected the connection as soon as Written() was true, which\nincludes the headers-only state (size == 0) reached via WriteHeaderNow\nor Flush. Websocket libraries such as github.com/coder/websocket hit\nthat state before hijacking. Only reject once body bytes are written.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"tool