{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAQnhJDXiZ2TDDUXbTtW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed `Hijack`, but I couldn't commit it: git has no author identity set in this environment. The changes are staged, and I didn't set an identity for you.\n\n**The problem:** `Hijack` refused to hand over the connection as soon as anything had been written, including when only the headers had gone out (after `WriteHeaderNow` or `Flush`). Websocket libraries like `github.com/coder/websocket` reach that headers-only state before they hijack, so they got `errHijackAlreadyWritten`.\n\n**What changed:**\n- `response_writer.go:111`: `Hijack` now refuses only once body bytes have been written. Hijacking before anything is written, or after only the headers, now works.\n- `response_writer_test.go`: added a test case for hijacking after `WriteHeaderNow`.\n\nI chose this over reworking how the response is tracked (the bigger alternative) because a one-line condition change fixes the problem without touching anything else.\n\n**Verified:**\n- The new test failed before the fix with `gin: response already written` and passes after it.\n- The existing case still holds: hijacking after a body write is still rejected.\n- `go test ./...` passes in every package, and `go vet` and `gofmt` are clean.\n\nTo commit, set `user.name` and `user.email`, then run `git commit` with the subject above. I'd drafted a message body explaining the why."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":576,"cache_read_input_tokens":39138,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":576,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04d8b101-d211-4cd2-a2e5-75dcfbfc8f80","uuid":"620f46ce-3583-4d96-bb9d-7c7d233fff3d","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:27:17.554Z","request_id":"req_011CgAQnh6KRmfe5gCc3Hb4C"}
